  <!-- EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <VFEI2_OpportunitySite_InsectoidHive.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>Missão expirada: [resolvedQuestName]</VFEI2_OpportunitySite_InsectoidHive.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The insectoid hive has established a new colony. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has expired. -->
  <VFEI2_OpportunitySite_InsectoidHive.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>A colmeia insetoide formou uma nova colônia. A missão [resolvedQuestName] expirou.</VFEI2_OpportunitySite_InsectoidHive.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Payment arrived -->
  <VFEI2_OpportunitySite_InsectoidHive.root.nodes.siteAllHivesAreDestroyed.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterLabel.slateRef>Pagamento chegou</VFEI2_OpportunitySite_InsectoidHive.root.nodes.siteAllHivesAreDestroyed.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterLabel.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: You have destroyed the insectoid hive!\n\nThe payment from [asker_faction_name] has arrived. -->
  <VFEI2_OpportunitySite_InsectoidHive.root.nodes.siteAllHivesAreDestroyed.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterText.slateRef>Você destruiu a colmeia insetoide!\n\nO pagamento de [asker_faction_name] chegou.</VFEI2_OpportunitySite_InsectoidHive.root.nodes.siteAllHivesAreDestroyed.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterText.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] -->
  <VFEI2_OpportunitySite_InsectoidHive.root.nodes.siteAllHivesAreDestroyed.node.nodes.GiveRewards.nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed.label.slateRef>[asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]</VFEI2_OpportunitySite_InsectoidHive.root.nodes.siteAllHivesAreDestroyed.node.nodes.GiveRewards.nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: These colonists participated in the victory for the quest [resolvedQuestName]. [asker_definite] wants to know who should receive the [royalFavorReward_amount] [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] for this service. -->
  <VFEI2_OpportunitySite_InsectoidHive.root.nodes.siteAllHivesAreDestroyed.node.nodes.GiveRewards.nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed.text.slateRef>Estes colonos participaram da vitória na missão [resolvedQuestName]. [asker_definite] quer saber quem deve receber [royalFavorReward_amount] de [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] por este serviço.</VFEI2_OpportunitySite_InsectoidHive.root.nodes.siteAllHivesAreDestroyed.node.nodes.GiveRewards.nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed.text.slateRef>
